          "widget": {
            "name": "title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Northpeak Lineage & Access \u2014 Governance Overview\n",
                "\n",
                "**The story** \u2014 three weeks ago **`mv_exec_revenue_daily`** was published. Its focused lineage now ends at **two Tableau dashboards, one Databricks dashboard, one notebook, and one governance agent** \u2014 while its upstream path includes **`customer_pii`**.\n",
                "\n",
                "**What to see** \u2014 the edge-trend line spikes 3 weeks ago (orange = the new MV's fan-out) \u00b7 the blast-radius bar puts `mv_exec_revenue_daily` on top with five direct endpoints \u00b7 the Criticality \u00d7 PII matrix flags `customer_pii`."
              ]
            }
